 <h3><u>Amma Fizza</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Haaye..Haaye...<br> haaye</p> 
  <p>Sajjad ka beta, shahzada baqer<br> jab aaya madine, sota hi nahi tha<br> bus rota tha..(2)<br> ek shab fizza ne aake kaha<br> shehzade, kyu sote nahi ho mere aaqa zade<br> maula baqer ne roke kaha<br> ammaa....<br> dekha hai in aankho ne dada ke kate sar ko<br> na bhulunga mai wo karbobala<br> padhunga sada yahi marsiya<br> han mai rounga<br> mai rounga amma fizza mai rounga, mai rounga..(2)</p> 
  <p>1. Dekha hai in ankho ne jab karbobala pohche<br> darya pe lage khaime, darya se hate khaime<br> na bhulunga mai, wo tifl o jawaa<br> the tashna dahaa, labe alqama<br> han mai rounga<br> amma fizza mai rounga, mai rounga..(2)</p> 
  <p>2. Dekha hai in ankho ne ashoor ka wo manzar<br> lashe hi bayaban se sheh laate rahe dinbhar<br> na bhulunga mai, wo ranjo alam<br> sare dasht e ghum, hue sar qalam<br> han mai rounga<br> amma fizza mai rounga, mai rounga..(2)</p> 
  <p>3. Dekha hai in ankho ne naizo pe shaheedo ko<br> aur shame gharibaa me jalte hue khaimo ko<br> na bhulunga mai, chini chadare<br> jali masnade, mere saamne<br> han mai rounga<br> amma fizza mai rounga, mai rounga..(2)</p> 
  <p>4. Dekha hai in ankho ne kaunain ki shehzadi<br> jis waqt bani qaidi ghaazi ko bulati thi<br> na bhulunga mai, haram ka safar<br> chale nange sar, rasan pehenkar<br> han mai rounga<br> amma fizza mai rounga, mai rounga..(2)</p> 
  <p>5. Dekha hai in ankho ne kaato pe safar karna<br> un shaam ki galiyo me ek qaidi ka khoo rona<br> na bhulunga mai, saje bamodar<br> har ek gaam par, wo naizo pe sar<br> han mai rounga<br> amma fizza mai rounga, mai rounga..(2)</p> 
  <p>6. Dekha hai in ankho ne us waqt aseeri me<br> shabbir ki dukhtar ko jab manga kaneezi me<br> na bhulunga mai, haram rodiye<br> sabhi karb se, tadapne lage<br> han mai rounga<br> amma fizza mai rounga, mai rounga..(2)</p> 
  <p>7. Dekha hai in ankho ne zindaan ka wo manzar<br> laasha tha sakina ka beemar ke hatho par<br> na bhulunga mai, phuphi ki qaza<br> kafan bangaya, wo kurta jala<br> han mai rounga<br> amma fizza mai rounga, mai rounga..(2)</p> 
  <p>8. Dekha hai in ankho ne zindaa se reha hoke<br> wo ujde hue qaidi jab karbobala pohche<br> na bhulunga mai, ke daadi meri<br> ye kehne lagi, behen aagayi<br> han mai rounga<br> amma fizza mai rounga, mai rounga..(2)</p> 
  <p>9. Dekha hai in ankho ne irfan e aza bankar<br> dekho mere chehre ko har ghum ka hai ye mazhar<br> na bhulunga mai, kabhi karbala<br> wo qaide jafa, dayare saza<br> han mai rounga<br> amma fizza mai rounga, mai rounga..(2)</p> 
